  "reasoning": "Building on the successful custom_cnn baseline, this hybrid approach leverages CNN feature extraction followed by GRU temporal modeling which is effective for audio sequences. The small size ensures CPU efficiency within the 90-minute budget while the GRU captures temporal dependencies important for bird species classification from 5-second clips."
}
